# The core's image is built from the repository's root, so the build sees contracts/ (ADR-140
# decision 2). Only the core's own files and the client API's contract enter the context: the root
# also holds data/, every node_modules/ and .venv/, and infra/deploy/.env, every password in it.
*
!src/backend/core/
!contracts/client-api/v1/
src/backend/core/target/
# A .env file anywhere in the build context, not only at its root, never enters an image
**/.env*
**/*.env
